{"id":"iznutri","lemma":"изнутри","pos":"adv","rank":1832,"glosses":["from within, from the inside, from inside, out of","on the inside"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a4/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%BD%D1%83%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%BD%D1%83%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Дверь была заперта изнутри.","en":"The door was locked from within.","words":[{"g":"door"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"Изнутри мы все похожи.","en":"We are all alike, on the inside.","words":[null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},null]},{"text":"Место было пустым изнутри.","en":"The place was empty inside.","words":[{"g":"place, spot"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null]},{"text":"Эта дверь закрыта изнутри.","en":"This door is locked from the inside.","words":[null,{"g":"door"},null,null]},{"text":"Настоящая красота исходит изнутри.","en":"True beauty comes from within.","words":[{"g":"present","l":"настоящий"},{"g":"beauty"},null,null]}]}